        <mxCell id="vL0Yoc6gRmufQnN6ViRZ-64" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EA6B66;" value="Wooden box embedded into the creek bed. Fits the outer box. A new implementation would benefit from using thicker wood than this." vertex="1">
